# wattleflow-core carries configuration in JSON only: the tools are
# stdlib-only and json is the sole structured format the standard library
# parses. The one exception is .github/workflows/*.yml, whose format GitHub
# imposes; it is already tracked, and .gitignore does not untrack files.
*.yaml
*.yml